# NewsCheck Optional Real-Time Fact-Checking API Keys
# Leave blank to use the high-accuracy offline Scikit-Learn + NLP Engine.

# 1. Google Gemini 1.5 Flash (Free tier at https://aistudio.google.com)
# Provides real-time web search grounding and AI investigative reasoning.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

